          "rendered": "— Видите ли, я не всегда работал дальнобойщиком. По профессии я кандидат философских наук. Но жить на зарплату преподавателя...\n",
          "page_id": "b2f0838e-3068-4850-ad2f-4944075de38b",
          "location_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "room_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "screen_kind": "page",
          "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
          "background": "images/8.jpg",
          "portion_index": 5,
          "portion_count": 17,
          "more": true,
          "room_text": "",
          "action_text": "",
          "objects_text": "",
          "player_text": "",
          "wolfiness": "1",
          "hp": "2",
          "barExit": "false",
          "forestExit": "false",
          "wolvesTalk": "false",
          "guardDone": "false",
          "end_screen": false
        },
        {
          "seq": 253,
          "kind": "scene",
          "command": "click true,1,960,540",
          "arguments": "",
          "rendered": "— он вздохнул. — Так вот, увидев вас, я отчего-то сразу вспомнил это мифическое существо. Оборотня.\n",
          "page_id": "b2f0838e-3068-4850-ad2f-4944075de38b",
          "location_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "room_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "screen_kind": "page",
          "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
          "background": "images/8.jpg",
          "portion_index": 6,
          "portion_count": 17,
          "more": true,
          "room_text": "",
          "action_text": "",
          "objects_text": "",
          "player_text": "",
          "wolfiness": "1",
          "hp": "2",
          "barExit": "false",
          "forestExit": "false",
          "wolvesTalk": "false",
          "guardDone": "false",
          "end_screen": false
        },
        {
          "seq": 257,
          "kind": "scene",
          "command": "click true,1,960,540",
          "arguments": "",
          "rendered": "— Меня никто не кусал, — зачем-то сказали вы.\n",
          "page_id": "b2f0838e-3068-4850-ad2f-4944075de38b",
          "location_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "room_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "screen_kind": "page",
          "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
          "background": "images/8.jpg",
          "portion_index": 7,
          "portion_count": 17,
          "more": true,
          "room_text": "",
          "action_text": "",
          "objects_text": "",
          "player_text": "",
          "wolfiness": "1",
          "hp": "2",
          "barExit": "false",
          "forestExit": "false",
          "wolvesTalk": "false",
          "guardDone": "false",
          "end_screen": false
        },
        {
          "seq": 261,
          "kind": "scene",
          "command": "click true,1,960,540",
          "arguments": "",
          "rendered": "— Для превращения в волколака это и не требуется! — радостно воскликнул мужик, счастливый от того, что нашёл собеседника.\n",
          "page_id": "b2f0838e-3068-4850-ad2f-4944075de38b",
          "location_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "room_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "screen_kind": "page",
          "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
          "background": "images/8.jpg",
          "portion_index": 8,
          "portion_count": 17,
          "more": true,
          "room_text": "",
          "action_text": "",
          "objects_text": "",
          "player_text": "",
          "wolfiness": "1",
          "hp": "2",
          "barExit": "false",
          "forestExit": "false",
          "wolvesTalk": "false",
          "guardDone": "false",
          "end_screen": false
        },
        {
          "seq": 265,
          "kind": "scene",
          "command": "click true,1,960,540",
          "arguments": "",
          "rendered": "Вот это уже было интересно. Вы весь превратились в слух.\n",
          "page_id": "b2f0838e-3068-4850-ad2f-4944075de38b",
          "location_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "room_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "screen_kind": "page",
          "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
          "background": "images/8.jpg",
          "portion_index": 9,
          "portion_count": 17,
          "more": true,
          "room_text": "",
          "action_text": "",
          "objects_text": "",
          "player_text": "",
          "wolfiness": "1",
          "hp": "2",
          "barExit": "false",
          "forestExit": "false",
          "wolvesTalk": "false",
          "guardDone": "false",
          "end_screen": false
        },
        {
          "seq": 269,
          "kind": "scene",
          "command": "click true,1,960,540",
          "arguments": "",
          "rendered": "— Достаточно накинуть волчью шкуру, произнести заклинание и дело сделано.\n",
          "page_id": "b2f0838e-3068-4850-ad2f-4944075de38b",
          "location_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "room_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "screen_kind": "page",
          "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
          "background": "images/8.jpg",
          "portion_index": 10,
          "portion_count": 17,
          "more": true,
          "room_text": "",
          "action_text": "",
          "objects_text": "",
          "player_text": "",
          "wolfiness": "1",
          "hp": "2",
          "barExit": "false",
          "forestExit": "false",
          "wolvesTalk": "false",
          "guardDone": "false",
          "end_screen": false
        },
        {
          "seq": 273,
          "kind": "scene",
          "command": "click true,1,960,540",
          "arguments": "",
          "rendered": "В этот момент принесли чай, но вам было не до него. Вы вспомнили, как несколько дней назад гостили у одного товарища в загородном доме. Там вы действительно примеряли волчью шкуру…\n",
          "page_id": "b2f0838e-3068-4850-ad2f-4944075de38b",
          "location_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "room_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "screen_kind": "page",
          "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
          "background": "images/8.jpg",
          "portion_index": 11,
          "portion_count": 17,
          "more": true,
          "room_text": "",
          "action_text": "",
          "objects_text": "",
          "player_text": "",
          "wolfiness": "1",
          "hp": "2",
          "barExit": "false",
          "forestExit": "false",
          "wolvesTalk": "false",
          "guardDone": "false",
          "end_screen": false
        },
        {
          "seq": 277,
          "kind": "scene",
          "command": "click true,1,960,540",
          "arguments": "",
          "rendered": "— Что самое интересное, — продолжал философ, — самый надёжный способ убить такого оборотня — это вонзить в него кол из боярышника.\n",
          "page_id": "b2f0838e-3068-4850-ad2f-4944075de38b",
          "location_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "room_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "screen_kind": "page",
          "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
          "background": "images/8.jpg",
          "portion_index": 12,
          "portion_count": 17,
          "more": true,
          "room_text": "",
          "action_text": "",
          "objects_text": "",
          "player_text": "",
          "wolfiness": "1",
          "hp": "2",
          "barExit": "false",
          "forestExit": "false",
          "wolvesTalk": "false",
          "guardDone": "false",
          "end_screen": false
        },
        {
          "seq": 281,
          "kind": "scene",
          "command": "click true,1,960,540",
          "arguments": "",
          "rendered": "Вы, я вижу, не хотите чай? Так я выпью, пока он не остыл. — С этими словами мужик взял чашку и, прежде чем вы успели его остановить, сделал большой глоток.\n",
          "page_id": "b2f0838e-3068-4850-ad2f-4944075de38b",
          "location_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "room_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "screen_kind": "page",
          "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
          "background": "images/8.jpg",
          "portion_index": 13,
          "portion_count": 17,
          "more": true,
          "room_text": "",
          "action_text": "",
          "objects_text": "",
          "player_text": "",
          "wolfiness": "1",
          "hp": "2",
          "barExit": "false",
          "forestExit": "false",
          "wolvesTalk": "false",
          "guardDone": "false",
          "end_screen": false
        },
        {
          "seq": 285,
          "kind": "scene",
          "command": "click true,1,960,540",
          "arguments": "",
          "rendered": "— А-а, хорошо. Зря не стали чай, очень недурственно.\n",
          "page_id": "b2f0838e-3068-4850-ad2f-4944075de38b",
          "location_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "room_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "screen_kind": "page",
          "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
          "background": "images/8.jpg",
          "portion_index": 14,
          "portion_count": 17,
          "more": true,
          "room_text": "",
          "action_text": "",
          "objects_text": "",
          "player_text": "",
          "wolfiness": "1",
          "hp": "2",
          "barExit": "false",
          "forestExit": "false",
          "wolvesTalk": "false",
          "guardDone": "false",
          "end_screen": false
        },
        {
          "seq": 289,
          "kind": "scene",
          "command": "click true,1,960,540",
          "arguments": "",
          "rendered": "Побагровев от ярости, вы встали из-за стола и практически выбежали из бара, стараясь не слушать возгласы нового знакомого, раздававшиеся вслед.\n",
          "page_id": "b2f0838e-3068-4850-ad2f-4944075de38b",
          "location_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "room_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "screen_kind": "page",
          "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
          "background": "images/8.jpg",
          "portion_index": 15,
          "portion_count": 17,
          "more": true,
          "room_text": "",
          "action_text": "",
          "objects_text": "",
          "player_text": "",
          "wolfiness": "1",
          "hp": "2",
          "barExit": "false",
          "forestExit": "false",
          "wolvesTalk": "false",
          "guardDone": "false",
          "end_screen": false
        },
        {
          "seq": 293,
          "kind": "scene",
          "command": "click true,1,960,540",
          "arguments": "",
          "rendered": "Решив отдохнуть в ближайшей роще, а вечером отправиться в дом злодея, заколдовавшего вас, вы спрятались в густом кустарнике, где и заснули под мерное гудение пчёл.\n",
          "page_id": "b2f0838e-3068-4850-ad2f-4944075de38b",
          "location_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "room_id": "v_b2f0838e_3068_4850_ad2f_4944075de38b",
          "screen_kind": "page",
          "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
          "background": "images/8.jpg",
          "portion_index": 16,
          "portion_count": 17,
